      "tag": "AI动态",
      "tagClass": "tag-neutral",
      "fullContent": "Runway News | Introducing Runway for Premiere Pro & After Effects\nEnterprise Sales Login Try Runway\nRunway AI Summit: 9/30 in San Francisco. Register now for the Runway AI Summit on 9/30 in San Francisco to hear from leaders at DeepMind, NVIDIA, Physical Intelligence and more.\nBuy tickets\nIntroducing Runway for Premiere Pro & After Effects\nSeptember 8, 2026\nby Runway\nAccess Runway’s models directly inside Premiere Pro and After Effects to generate, edit and upscale without leaving your timeline.\nToday we're introducing Runway Plugins. With our new Adobe plugin, a Runway panel runs inside the iconic Premiere Pro and After Effects apps. Generate images and video, restyle the footage on your timeline and place every result directly into your comp or sequence.\nStay in the Edit\nUntil now, using Runway mid-edit meant leaving it: export a frame, upload it to a browser tab, download the result, re-import it and find your place again. Our panel eliminates that loop altogether. Prompt from inside After Effects or Premiere, watch the generation resolve in the feed and click to place it. In Premiere, results land at your playhead, ready to trim.\nYour Footage, Not Just New Footage\nEdit Studio works on the clip you already have: select it in your comp or sequence, restyle its anchor frames, and Aleph 2 re-renders the full clip to match at the same duration as your source. Compare before and after in the panel, then drop it back into the edit.\nOne Account, Every Surface\nSign in from the panel and generations use your existing plan and credits, with a workspace switcher for people who work across teams. HDR conversion, background removal and upscaling are one click away on any selected clip or feed asset.\nPricing and Availability\nRunway Plugins are free to download for macOS and Windows from our plugin page . Generating from the plugin is available on all paid plans and uses your existing plan credits.\nGet started with the new Runway Plugins .\nDiscover more\nCompany News\nIntroducing Runway Media Router\nCustomer Stories\nHow Chime Used Runway to Produce Their Latest National TV Spot\nCompany News\nThe AI Media Report: Cost, Speed and What Comes Next"
