      "publishedAt": "2026-09-03T20:55:50.000Z",
      "discoveredAt": "2026-09-03T21:10:23.915Z",
      "summary": "Rohan Paul 梳理 OpenAI GPT-6 Astra 117 页系统卡的要点：Astra 控制自身链式思维的能力从 GPT-5.6 Sol 的 16.1% 跃升至 60.9%，可监控性相应下降。",
      "category": "c6",
      "score": 78,
