      "title_en": "Grok Bot for Enterprise",
      "url": "https://x.ai/news/grok-bot-for-enterprise",
      "permalink": "https://aihot.news/items/cmtm1k75y0ue9row58wfax9nf",
      "source": "xAI：News（网页）",
      "publishedAt": "2026-09-03T00:00:00.000Z",
      "discoveredAt": "2026-09-03T21:32:36.611Z",
      "summary": "xAI 宣布 Grok Bot 面向企业开放，Grok 和 Cursor Enterprise 客户未来两周可免费使用并邀请全组织成员，包括没有现有席位的员工。",
      "category": "c6",
      "score": 60,
