      "fullContent": "Claude on X: \"Claude can now use your computer in the background in Claude Cowork and Claude Code.\nGive it something to do on your desktop and Claude clicks, types, and opens apps just like you would, while you work on something else.\" / X Post\nLog in Sign up\nPost\nClaude on X: \"Claude can now use your computer in the background in Claude Cowork and Claude Code.\nGive it something to do on your desktop and Claude clicks, types, and opens apps just like you would, while you work on something else.\"\nClaude\n@claudeai\nClaude can now use your computer in the background in Claude Cowork and Claude Code.\nGive it something to do on your desktop and Claude clicks, types, and opens apps just like you would, while you work on something else.\n19:06 · 2026年9月2日 184万 Views\n614\n690\n1.2万\n3092\nClaude\n@claudeai\nClaude can now use your computer in the background in Claude Cowork and Claude Code.\nGive it something to do on your desktop and Claude clicks, types, and opens apps just like you would, while you work on something else.\n19:06 · 2026年9月2日 184万 Views\n614\n690\n1.2万\n3092\nClaude\n@claudeai\n9月2日\nAvailable in beta on Pro and Max plans, in the desktop app on macOS.\nIf you're new to computer use, turn it on in Settings → General → Computer use.\nHow it works, and how to use it safely:\nLet Claude use your computer in Cowork | Anthropic Help Center\nFrom support.claude.com\n90\n29\n668\n19万\nNous Research\n@NousResearch\n9月2日\nYou guys didn't have computer use yet?? 😭\n83\n16\n1655\n6.2万"
